# 🚨 3️⃣0️⃣ Common Mistakes

### Mistake 1

Adding times:

$$
10+20=30
$$

❌ Wrong.

You add **rates**, not times.

---

### Mistake 2

Treating an outlet as positive.

❌ Wrong.

Emptying rate is negative.

---

### Mistake 3

Using workers × days when worker efficiency changes.

❌ Not valid unless efficiencies are comparable.

---

### Mistake 4

Confusing efficiency and time.

Remember:

$$
\boxed{Efficiency\propto\frac1{Time}}
$$

