# 🧠 TODAY'S FORMULA CARD

### Basic rate

$$
\boxed{Rate=\frac1{Time}}
$$

### Combined work

$$
\boxed{R_{total}=R_1+R_2+\cdots}
$$

### Combined time — two people

$$
\boxed{
T=\frac{T_1T_2}{T_1+T_2}
}
$$

### Workers

$$
\boxed{Workers\times Days=Constant}
$$

### Workers + hours

$$
\boxed{
Workers\times Days\times Hours=Constant
}
$$

### Efficiency

$$
\boxed{Efficiency\propto\frac1{Time}}
$$

### Pipes

$$
\boxed{Fill=+}
$$

$$
\boxed{Empty=-}
$$

### Net pipe rate

$$
\boxed{
R_{net}=R_{fill}-R_{empty}
}
$$

