# 🧠 🔥 ONE-MINUTE MEMORY MAP

```text
                 TIME & WORK
                      │
             Work = Rate × Time
                      │
             Rate = 1 / Time
                      │
        ┌─────────────┼─────────────┐
        ↓             ↓             ↓
     People        Efficiency      Pipes
        │             │             │
 Workers×Days     ↑ efficiency     Fill = +
   = constant       ↓ time         Empty = -
        │
        ↓
   More workers
        ↓
   Less time
```

### ⭐ Golden rule:

> **Never add times. Add work rates.**

